    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "2. gurai 'about'\n\nThe word gurai is comparable to English 'about' or 'approximately.' Note that in Japanese gurai follows the quantity expression while in English 'about' or 'approximately' precedes.\n\nExamples:\na. 10-pun gurai desu.        (It's) about 10 minutes.\nb. 50 meetoru gurai desu.    (It's) about 50 meters."
    }
